So I guess the installer repo. But that team is pretty booked, so it would likely be something that someone motivated would have to step up to contribute.

review_comments:
the overhead is <1ns in most benchmarks even with small inputs, but the potential benefits are huge in some cases e.g.:
```csharp
"ababababababa".Contains("ava"); 
// ^ 40ns vs 5ns -> 8x faster with "find unique ch2"

"abababababaabababababababaabababababaabababbabababbbaa".Contains("azaaaaaaaaa");
// ^ 80ns vs 10ns -> 8x faster with "find unique ch2"
// despite the fact we had enumerate all chars in value to find 'z'
```
